These two edits:

- Stop applying the “--disabled” colour to your form label when you are either in the normal or “invalid” states (restoring full contrast).  
- Remove the Open/Close “aria-label” on the combobox trigger so that assistive tools pick up the real text in the `<label>` above it via `aria-labelledby`.
